    "market_commentary": "After a brief pause, the SSY Atlantic Capesize Index has continued its advance, rising 409 points week-onweek to 11,996 points. Fronthaul and trans-Atlantic earnings climbed for the seventh consecutive week, up $6,000/day and $2,000/day from last week to a respective $52,500/day and $40,150/day.",
